145	시청 판정 SQL (lecture 행 L, 회원 M)
146	
147	```sql
148	SELECT 1 FROM lecture_access la JOIN entitlements e ON e.id = la.entitlement_id
149	 WHERE e.member_id = :M AND (e.expires_at IS NULL OR e.expires_at > :now)
150	   AND ( (la.scope='common'        AND :L_kind='common')
151	      OR (la.scope='unit'          AND :L_kind='unit'    AND la.unit_code=:L_unit)
152	      OR (la.scope='unit_passages' AND :L_kind='passage' AND la.unit_code=:L_unit)
153	      OR (la.scope='passage'       AND :L_kind='passage' AND la.set_id=:L_set) ) LIMIT 1;
154	```
